# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Build / distribution artifacts
*.zip
/tmp/

# CSV preview/exports and result files produced by the plugin.
# These carry a settings header naming the configured M3U sources, which on a
# real installation is the provider hostname, so they must never be committed.
channel_mapparr_*.csv
channel_mapparr_*.json
*_preview.csv
*_preview_strict.csv

# Tooling caches
Channel-Maparr/.serena/
.serena/

# Windows reserved-name junk file
Channel-Maparr/nul

# Agent and contributor notes. These are working notes about this installation,
# not documentation for users of the plugin, and this repository is public.
# They were tracked until 2026-08-02 and are therefore already in the published
# history; ignoring them stops any further publication.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.claude/
.wolf/

# Local planning documents: designs and implementation plans written while
# working on a change. The finished result belongs in docs/CHANGELOG.md and
# docs/USER-GUIDE.md, which are for users. Newsflasharr treats this directory
# the same way.
docs/superpowers/

# Local editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The pre-prune copy of the agent notes. Ignored for the same reason CLAUDE.md is:
# this repository is public and the notes are about this installation, not about the
# plugin. The sibling projects TRACK their archive; this one must not.
CLAUDE-HISTORY.md

# FCC LMS database dumps the operator downloads for station table rebuilds.
# These are hundreds of megabytes and must never enter the repository.
*_LMS_Dump/
*_LMS_Dump.zip
Current_LMS_Dump/
